 useEffect(()=>{if(!draftLoaded||(!demoMode&&!accessToken)||!activeDraftId)return;setAutosaveState("saving");const t=setTimeout(()=>{const owner=demoMode?`demo:${demoName}`:`account:${authEmail||"user"}`;const draft={id:activeDraftId,title,description,selectedColor,sequenceName,sequenceColor,activityName,sequences,courseLayout,competence,objective,contentText,contentFiles,step,savedAt:new Date().toISOString()};const list=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(`trainer-drafts:${owner}`)||"[]");const next=[draft,...list.filter((d:any)=>d.id!==activeDraftId)];localStorage.setItem(`trainer-drafts:${owner}`,JSON.stringify(next));localStorage.setItem(`trainer-draft:${owner}`,JSON.stringify(draft));setDrafts(next);setAutosaveState("saved")},650);return()=>clearTimeout(t)},[draftLoaded,activeDraftId,demoMode,accessToken,demoName,title,description,selectedColor,sequenceName,sequenceColor,activityName,sequences,courseLayout,competence,objective,contentText,contentFiles,step]);
 async function authenticate(){setAuthError("");const endpoint=authMode==="login"?"/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password":"/auth/v1/signup";const body=authMode==="login"?{email:authEmail,password:authPassword}:{email:authEmail,password:authPassword,data:{full_name:authName}};const r=await fetch(`${SUPABASE_URL}${endpoint}`,{method:"POST",headers:{apikey:SUPABASE_KEY,"Content-Type":"application/json"},body:JSON.stringify(body)});const data=await r.json();if(!r.ok){setAuthError(data?.msg||data?.error_description||"Connexion impossible.");return}if(data.access_token){localStorage.setItem("trainer-session",JSON.stringify(data));setAccessToken(data.access_token)}else setAuthError("Compte créé. Consultez votre e-mail pour confirmer votre inscription.")}
